  "content": {
    "id": "p9-q2-response",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "2",
    "prompt": "Three towns are located at coordinates $O(0,0)$, $A(8,0)$ and $B(0,6)$, where all distances are measured in kilometres. There is a straight road that joins towns $A$ and $B$. A third straight road is to join the town at $O$ to the existing road. What is the shortest possible length of this road?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p9-q2-short-result",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "4.8\\text{ km}",
                "display": false
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p9-q2-short-method",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The shortest road is perpendicular to AB; equate two expressions for the triangle’s area.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Let $x$ kilometres be the length of $AB$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2&=6^2+8^2\\\\x^2&=100\\\\x&=10\\end{align*}$$\nThe shortest road is perpendicular to $AB$. Let its length be $h$ kilometres. Equating two expressions for the area of $\\triangle AOB$ gives\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10h}{2}&=\\frac{6\\times8}{2}\\\\10h&=48\\\\h&=4.8\\end{align*}$$\nThe shortest possible road is $4.8\\text{ km}$ long.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 84
